        "model_count": 1,
        "cost": null,
        "witnesses": [
          [
            "nx(1)",
            "nx(2)"
          ]
        ],
        "required_symbols": [],
        "notes": [
          "Two existential variables; the core is the pigeonhole formula with 5 pigeons and 4 holes (20 universal variables, 45 clauses). The first existential assignment gets the whole contradiction, the other three lose one clause each.",
          "Every candidate's minimality check carries work, since the satisfiable cores are hard to search too. At 6 holes the subset queries walk about 33,000 regions."
        ]
      }
    },
